guide forever/miscellaneous/library-books
title Library Books
category Miscellaneous
keywords Library, books, Friend of the Library, Greater Friend of the Library, Garion Wendell, Owen Thadd, Comprehension Charm, Scholarly Pendant, Erudite's Amulet, Field Researcher's Loop, Philanthropist's Ring, Truthseeker's Bow, Crest of Elucidation, Researcher's Night Light
reward item 277203 277204
reward item 281634 281635
reward item 277254 277258 277260
why Lost books and scrolls all over the world: each pays experience at the library, and enough of them earn a Friend of the Library reward.
levels 20-50
zone Stormwind City

# The library book quests Forever kept from Season of Discovery. Each book is
# an item looted from an object (the Mural of Ta'zo: used) that starts its
# quest; every class can loot and hand them in, mages also get a Comprehension
# Charm. Garion Wendell (Stormwind Mage Quarter) takes them for the Alliance,
# Owen Thadd (Undercity Magic Quarter) for the Horde. The books are kept in the
# bags and their quests accepted at the librarian, one at a time, so the quest
# log never fills: there are more books than it holds.
#
# Order: Eastern Kingdoms from Elwynn south, then north, then Kalimdor from
# Darkshore south. Alliance-only: Antonidas and Rumi (the wiki names only
# Garion Wendell for them), Theocritus, Runes of the Sorcerer-Kings and both
# Greater Friend of the Library quests (their race masks in data/forever).
# Horde-only: Ta'zo (the wiki) and the Apothecary's Primer (race mask).
# Ta'zo, Demons and You and Legends of the Tidesages are items data/forever
# lacks, so they carry their names here (lint warns that it cannot fill them).
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, items, librarians: data/forever (QuestieDB Forever).
# - Book object ids and spawns: QuestieDB @ e9a67d1a2753a0e64c4c96bf7864788fac7b765f,
#   src/corrections/Forever/foreverObjectFixes.lua (hand-written Forever fixes,
#   one entry per book object); warcraft.wiki.gg book pages (CC BY-SA 3.0) for
#   405879, 421526 and 441248, which those fixes do not place, and as a check
#   on every other point. Not used: QuestieDB's generated SoD and Forever base
#   object files (built from Wowhead).
# - Where each book sits (the tips) and the milestone rewards: warcraft.wiki.gg
#   and Wowhead's Forever quest pages and comments from the local archive.
# - data/forever puts an Elwynn spawn (65.4,70.1) on 386691, the Antonidas
#   book; both sources above place 386691 in Ironforge only and that Elwynn
#   point on 386759 (Theocritus). The goals below are placed by hand.
# - The milestone quests (Friend of the Library 78150, Greater Friend of the
#   Library 79536 and 82208) are offered by the librarian once enough books are
#   handed in; their levels are the data's. How many books each takes is not in
#   any source we use, so the steps do not count them.
# Not play-tested on Forever yet.

step Elwynn Forest
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Halfway up the Tower of Azora, east of Goldshire. Nothing hostile inside.
  collect 203755 @65.4,70.1                  -- Archmage Theocritus' Research Journal

step Westfall
  zone Westfall
  tip Two books: one in a house at Moonbrook, one at Sentinel Hill (Alliance only).
  collect 209845 @45.4,70.4                  -- Bewitchments and Glamours
  collect 208860 @52.7,53.8 only Alliance    -- Rumi of Gnomeregan

step Duskwood
  zone Duskwood
  tip The spellbook lies in the Dawning Wood Catacombs, the crypt in north-western Duskwood. Undead fill it; a corpse run works if you are low.
  collect 209849 @16.7,28.4                  -- Crimes Against Anatomy

step Stranglethorn Vale
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip On a bench beside the Crystalvein Mine entrance, in the middle of the zone.
  collect 213165 @41.5,50.9                  -- Basilisks: Should Petrification be Feared?

step Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip On the top walkway of the Temple of Atal'Hakkar, outside the dungeon.
  collect 220345 @70,51                      -- Sanguine Sorcery

step Blasted Lands
  zone Blasted Lands
  collect 220353 @55.4,32.2                  -- Conjurer's Codex

step Blackrock Mountain
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Inside Blackrock Mountain, not in a dungeon: the book lies on the altar in Franclorn Forgewright's tomb, near Lothos Riftwaker. The waypoint marks the mountain.
  collect 220349 @28.96,28.93                -- Stonewrought Design

step Searing Gorge
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip On a table inside a tent near the middle of the zone.
  collect 220352 @37.8,49.3                  -- A Mind of Metal

step Badlands
  zone Badlands
  tip Inside a crypt near the middle of the zone, reached from the path to its south.
  collect 215820 @56.7,39.9                  -- Mummies: A Guide to the Unsavory Undead

step Loch Modan
  only Alliance
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Two books: scrolls in the Mo'grosh ogre cave in the north-east, and the Gnomish Tome in Thelsamar.
  collect 209850 @77.4,14                    -- Runes of the Sorcerer-Kings
  collect 208860 @35.6,48.9                  -- Rumi of Gnomeregan

step Ironforge
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  collect 203754 @76,10.4                    -- Archmage Antonidas: The Unabridged Autobiography

step Wetlands
  zone Wetlands
  collect 209848 @33.6,47.9                  -- Goaz Scrolls

step Arathi Highlands
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Beside a tent entrance in the troll village in south-eastern Arathi.
  collect 215816 @73.6,65.2                  -- A Web of Lies: Debunking Myths and Legends

step The Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  collect 220350 @36,72.8                    -- Venomous Journeys

step Alterac Mountains
  zone Alterac Mountains
  collect 215815 @48.4,57.6                  -- Defensive Magics 101

step Silverpine Forest
  zone Silverpine Forest
  collect 209844 @63.5,63.2                  -- The Dalaran Digest

step Tirisfal Glades
  only Horde
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip On a shelf in Brill's apothecary.
  collect 208185 @59.4,52.3                  -- The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer

step Darkshore
  zone Darkshore
  tip Down the stairs at the Ruins of Mathystra in northern Darkshore.
  collect 209843 @59.6,22.2                  -- Nar'thalas Almanac

step Azshara
  zone Azshara
  tip On a crate in the Haldarr Encampment, in the far west of Azshara.
  collect 220348 @20.7,62                    -- Everyday Etiquette

step Orgrimmar
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The Mural of Ta'zo is the stone tablet leaning against the wall in the Valley of Spirits, on the way to the mage trainers. Use it to take the book.
  collect 207972 "The Lessons of Ta'zo" @38.7,78.4

step The Barrens
  zone The Barrens
  tip Three books: scrolls outside the Wailing Caverns entrance, the manual in the control room at the top of the oil rig at the Sludge Fen, and the Goblin Tome beside Gazlowe in Ratchet.
  collect 209846 @49.3,32.9                  -- Secrets of the Dreamers
  collect 209847 @56.3,8.8                   -- Arcanic Systems Manual
  collect 208800 @62.7,36.3                  -- Baxtan: On Destructive Magics

step Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip On a barrel in a tent at Grimtotem Post, in the far south-east of the zone.
  collect 209851 @74.4,85.7                  -- Fury of the Land

step Desolace
  zone Desolace
  collect 215817 "Demons and You" @55,26.2

step Thousand Needles
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Inside a hut on the Darkcloud Pinnacle mesa.
  collect 215683 @34.4,40.1                  -- Geomancy: The Stone-Cold Truth

step Dustwallow Marsh
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip On the ground at the eastern side of the murloc camp in north-eastern Dustwallow.
  collect 215822 @57.2,20.8                  -- RwlRwlRwlRwl!

step Tanaris
  zone Tanaris
  tip On a bookshelf in the middle building of the pirate camp on the eastern coast.
  collect 220346 "Legends of the Tidesages" @72.6,47.8

