step Friend of the Library
  tip Once enough books are in, the librarian offers Friend of the Library. Take it when it appears.
  accept 78150 npc 211033 optional only Alliance
  turnin 78150 npc 211033 optional only Alliance
  accept 78150 npc 211022 optional only Horde
  turnin 78150 npc 211022 optional only Horde

step Greater Friend of the Library
  only Alliance
  tip From level 20, with more books handed in, Garion Wendell offers Greater Friend of the Library.
  level 20
  accept 79536 npc 211033 optional
  turnin 79536 npc 211033 optional

step The second Greater Friend of the Library
  only Alliance
  tip From level 30, with more books still, Garion Wendell offers the second Greater Friend of the Library.
  level 30
  accept 82208 npc 211033 optional
  turnin 82208 npc 211033 optional
